    <div id="event-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl animate-in-zoom">
        <div class="p-6 max-h-[70vh] overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar relative">
          <button onclick="closeModal('event-modal')" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-gray-400">
            <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </button>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 pr-6">全网矩阵触达 · 赋能品牌传播</h2>
          <div class="w-12 h-1.5 bg-sky-500 rounded-full mb-5"></div>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify whitespace-pre-line">
            佛山市新闻传媒中心整合旗下电视、广播、报纸及新媒体矩阵资源，倾力打造立体化的大健康垂直传播频道。为生物医药、医疗器械等大健康企业提供品牌塑造、科普宣导、活动直播等全链路媒体服务，助力企业提升社会影响力。

